{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 4,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 451.62,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I spake unto my brethren, saying:",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.756,
      "end": 6.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let us go up again unto Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.397,
      "end": 9.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and let us be faithful in keeping the commandments of the Lord;",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.014,
      "end": 13.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold he is mightier than all the earth,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.213,
      "end": 16.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then why not mightier than Laban and his fifty,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.272,
      "end": 18.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, or even than his tens of thousands?",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.599,
      "end": 21.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore let us go up;",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 21.312,
      "end": 23.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let us be strong like unto Moses;",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 23.814,
      "end": 27.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he truly spake unto the waters of the Red Sea",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.616,
      "end": 29.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they divided hither and thither,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.118,
      "end": 34.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our fathers came through, out of captivity, on dry ground,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.57,
      "end": 36.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the armies of Pharaoh did follow",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.118,
      "end": 40.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were drowned in the waters of the Red Sea.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.817,
      "end": 42.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold ye know that this is true;",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.087,
      "end": 46.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye also know that an angel hath spoken unto you;",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.843,
      "end": 48.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore can ye doubt?",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 48.463,
      "end": 49.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let us go up;",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 49.943,
      "end": 52.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord is able to deliver us,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 52.259,
      "end": 53.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as our fathers,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 54.064,
      "end": 55.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to destroy Laban,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 55.823,
      "end": 57.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as the Egyptians.",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 57.943,
      "end": 61.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when I had spoken these words, they were yet wroth,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 61.652,
      "end": 63.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did still continue to murmur;",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 64.015,
      "end": 66.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they did follow me up",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 66.61,
      "end": 69.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until we came without the walls of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 69.798,
      "end": 71.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was by night;",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 71.743,
      "end": 75.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I caused that they should hide themselves without the walls.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 75.545,
      "end": 78.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they had hid themselves,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 78.233,
      "end": 80.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Nephi, crept into the city",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 81.014,
      "end": 83.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth towards the house of Laban.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 84.202,
      "end": 86.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I was led by the Spirit,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 86.75,
      "end": 89.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not knowing beforehand the things which I should do.",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 90.356,
      "end": 92.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless I went forth,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 92.301,
      "end": 95.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as I came near unto the house of Laban",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 95.732,
      "end": 97.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld a man,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 97.537,
      "end": 100.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he had fallen to the earth before me,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 100.225,
      "end": 102.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he was drunken with wine.",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 102.716,
      "end": 106.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when I came to him I found that it was Laban.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 107.018,
      "end": 108.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I beheld his sword,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 108.916,
      "end": 111.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I drew it forth from the sheath thereof;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 111.882,
      "end": 114.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the hilt thereof was of pure gold,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 114.57,
      "end": 117.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the workmanship thereof was exceedingly fine,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 117.954,
      "end": 121.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw that the blade thereof was of the most precious steel.",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 122.349,
      "end": 125.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I was constrained by the Spirit",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 125.78,
      "end": 127.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should kill Laban;",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 127.678,
      "end": 129.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I said in my heart:",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 129.576,
      "end": 132.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Never at any time have I shed the blood of man.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 132.728,
      "end": 135.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I shrunk and would that I might not slay him.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 136.519,
      "end": 138.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Spirit said unto me again:",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 138.975,
      "end": 142.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold the Lord hath delivered him into thy hands.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 142.313,
      "end": 146.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I also knew that he had sought to take away mine own life;",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 146.58,
      "end": 150.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he would not hearken unto the commandments of the Lord;",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 150.661,
      "end": 153.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also had taken away our property.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 153.709,
      "end": 156.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Spirit said unto me again:",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 157.093,
      "end": 158.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Slay him,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 158.573,
      "end": 161.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord hath delivered him into thy hands;",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 162.225,
      "end": 164.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold the Lord slayeth the wicked",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 164.681,
      "end": 166.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to bring forth his righteous purposes.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 167.137,
      "end": 169.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It is better that one man should perish",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 169.593,
      "end": 173.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than that a nation should dwindle and perish in unbelief.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 173.849,
      "end": 177.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when I, Nephi, had heard these words,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 177.187,
      "end": 179.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I remembered the words of the Lord",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 179.643,
      "end": 182.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake unto me in the wilderness, saying that:",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 183.074,
      "end": 186.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Inasmuch as thy seed shall keep my commandments,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 186.505,
      "end": 189.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall prosper in the land of promise.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 189.739,
      "end": 195.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I also thought that they could not keep the commandments of the Lord according to the law of Moses,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 196.096,
      "end": 198.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save they should have the law.",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 198.866,
      "end": 204.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also knew that the law was engraven upon the plates of brass.",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 205.165,
      "end": 210.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, I knew that the Lord had delivered Laban into my hands for this cause\u2014",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 210.314,
      "end": 213.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might obtain the records according to his commandments.",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 214.616,
      "end": 217.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore I did obey the voice of the Spirit,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 217.629,
      "end": 220.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took Laban by the hair of the head,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 220.503,
      "end": 223.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I smote off his head with his own sword.",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 223.83,
      "end": 226.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after I had smitten off his head with his own sword,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 227.029,
      "end": 232.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I took the garments of Laban and put them upon mine own body; yea, even every whit;",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 232.968,
      "end": 235.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did gird on his armor about my loins.",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 236.295,
      "end": 237.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after I had done this,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 238.1,
      "end": 240.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I went forth unto the treasury of Laban.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 240.788,
      "end": 243.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as I went forth towards the treasury of Laban,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 244.079,
      "end": 248.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I saw the servant of Laban who had the keys of the treasury.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 248.206,
      "end": 253.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I commanded him in the voice of Laban, that he should go with me into the treasury.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 254.041,
      "end": 256.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he supposed me to be his master, Laban,",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 257.147,
      "end": 258.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he beheld the garments",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 259.092,
      "end": 261.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the sword girded about my loins.",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 262.094,
      "end": 265.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake unto me concerning the elders of the Jews,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 265.525,
      "end": 267.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he knowing that his master, Laban,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 267.934,
      "end": 270.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had been out by night among them.",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 270.936,
      "end": 274.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I spake unto him as if it had been Laban.",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 274.774,
      "end": 276.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also spake unto him",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 276.719,
      "end": 281.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should carry the engravings, which were upon the plates of brass,",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 281.404,
      "end": 283.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to my elder brethren,",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 283.395,
      "end": 285.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were without the walls.",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 285.933,
      "end": 288.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also bade him that he should follow me.",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 289.353,
      "end": 293.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he, supposing that I spake of the brethren of the church,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 293.666,
      "end": 296.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I was truly that Laban whom I had slain,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 297.004,
      "end": 298.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he did follow me.",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 299.402,
      "end": 303.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake unto me many times concerning the elders of the Jews,",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 303.483,
      "end": 307.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as I went forth unto my brethren, who were without the walls.",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 308.203,
      "end": 310.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Laman saw me",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 311.03,
      "end": 314.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was exceedingly frightened, and also Lemuel and Sam.",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 314.925,
      "end": 317.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they fled from before my presence;",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 317.52,
      "end": 319.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they supposed it was Laban,",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 319.697,
      "end": 321.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he had slain me",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 321.735,
      "end": 324.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had sought to take away their lives also.",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 325.201,
      "end": 327.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I called after them,",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 328.075,
      "end": 329.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did hear me;",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 329.834,
      "end": 332.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore they did cease to flee from my presence.",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 333.625,
      "end": 338.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the servant of Laban beheld my brethren",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 338.31,
      "end": 339.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he began to tremble,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 339.976,
      "end": 342.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was about to flee from before me",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 342.571,
      "end": 344.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and return to the city of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 345.573,
      "end": 349.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, being a man large in stature,",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 349.282,
      "end": 352.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also having received much strength of the Lord,",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 352.759,
      "end": 356.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I did seize upon the servant of Laban,",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 356.283,
      "end": 357.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and held him,",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 358.042,
      "end": 359.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should not flee.",
      "verse": "4:31",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 360.208,
      "end": 365.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I spake with him, that if he would hearken unto my words,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 365.543,
      "end": 367.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as the Lord liveth,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 367.256,
      "end": 368.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as I live,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 368.783,
      "end": 372.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so that if he would hearken unto our words,",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 372.4,
      "end": 373.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we would spare his life.",
      "verse": "4:32",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 374.659,
      "end": 376.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I spake unto him,",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 376.511,
      "end": 378.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even with an oath,",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 378.224,
      "end": 379.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he need not fear;",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 380.029,
      "end": 382.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should be a free man like unto us",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 382.949,
      "end": 385.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if he would go down in the wilderness with us.",
      "verse": "4:33",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 386.137,
      "end": 388.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also spake unto him, saying:",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 388.267,
      "end": 391.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Surely the Lord hath commanded us to do this thing;",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 391.558,
      "end": 396.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall we not be diligent in keeping the commandments of the Lord?",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 396.521,
      "end": 400.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, if thou wilt go down into the wilderness to my father",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 400.416,
      "end": 402.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt have place with us.",
      "verse": "4:34",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 402.861,
      "end": 407.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Zoram did take courage at the words which I spake.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 407.36,
      "end": 409.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Zoram was the name of the servant;",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 409.862,
      "end": 414.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he promised that he would go down into the wilderness unto our father.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 414.686,
      "end": 417.287,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and he also made an oath unto us",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 417.467,
      "end": 420.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would tarry with us from that time forth.",
      "verse": "4:35",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 421.166,
      "end": 429.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we were desirous that he should tarry with us for this cause, that the Jews might not know concerning our flight into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "4:36",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 429.705,
      "end": 432.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they should pursue us and destroy us.",
      "verse": "4:36",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 432.939,
      "end": 436.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Zoram had made an oath unto us,",
      "verse": "4:37",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 436.788,
      "end": 439.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "our fears did cease concerning him.",
      "verse": "4:37",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 440.208,
      "end": 443.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we took the plates of brass",
      "verse": "4:38",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 443.639,
      "end": 445.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the servant of Laban,",
      "verse": "4:38",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 445.63,
      "end": 447.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and departed into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "4:38",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 448.132,
      "end": 450.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and journeyed unto the tent of our father.",
      "verse": "4:38",
      "lineIndex": 148
    }
  ]
}